Package: shinytoxcalc
Title: A Graphical Interface to the toxcalc EPA WET Methods
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Rebecca", "Fisher", , "r.fisher@aims.gov.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application providing a point-and-click interface to the
    'toxcalc' package, which implements the US EPA Whole Effluent Toxicity
    statistical methods. Data are entered by pasting, by uploading a
    comma-separated file, or by uploading a spreadsheet laid out to the
    supplied template. Results are presented as the decision trail that
    justifies the selected test, alongside the endpoints and a
    concentration-response plot, and can be exported as a report, a
    spreadsheet, or the R code that reproduces the analysis.
License: GPL (>= 2)
